# Local data. Committed on purpose: data/README.md, the sample CSV inputs under
# data/import-samples/, and the coursework product-image folder
# (data/product-images/images/), so every developer gets the same fixtures.
# Original downloads, generated output, source-verification
# records, and scratch research stay local.
/data/*
!/data/README.md
!/data/import-samples/
!/data/import-samples/*.csv
!/data/product-images/
!/data/research/
/data/product-images/originals/
/data/product-images/image-urls.csv
/data/product-images/provenance/
